但我入选了
But I'm in the mix.

339
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:28,020
他们真心要我留在这里
They actually want me here.

340
00:16:28,180 --> 00:16:29,840
但我也要你去那里陪我
But I want you there.

341
00:16:31,500 --> 00:16:33,320
你应该和我这个蠢货在一起
I'm the stupid you should be with.

342
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:36,520
好吧 不管了
All right, screw it.

343
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:38,160
苏菲 我要跟她走
Sophie, I'm gonna go with her.

344
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:40,360
做过这么多坏决定 也不差这一个
Why stop making bad decisions now?

345
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:45,320
好吧 但我得在队伍里再交一个朋友
All right, but I'm gonna have to make another friend in line.

346
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:50,100
你好 我是芭布
Hi, I'm Barb.

347
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:55,980
老天 拼车和花生奶油三明治真是...
Oh, gosh, carpool and fluffernutter...

348
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:00,960
都怪小孩要踢足球 对吧
because soccer, right?

349
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:11,100
麦克斯 这算是我们第一场好莱坞派对
Max, this is kind of our first Hollywood party.

350
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,580
我知道 我很好奇我会跟谁回家
I know. I wonder who I'll go home with.

351
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:16,040
估计又是安德鲁·戴斯·克雷吧
Probably Andrew Dice Clay again.

352
00:17:17,220 --> 00:17:18,280
听着 这可能是
Hey listen, this might be

353
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:20,180
第六杯小小龙舌兰酒的胡话
the sixth teeny, tiny, tequila talking,

354
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:22,140
但谢谢你站出来维护我
but thanks for standing up for me

355
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:24,160
没有让那些编剧把我从你的人生中踢出去
and not letting those writers cut me out of your life.

356
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:27,000
麦克斯 这番话意义非凡
Oh, Max, that means a lot.

357
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:29,560
我喜欢你喝醉时友好的样子
I love it when you're drunk and nice.

358
00:17:33,580 --> 00:17:35,140
不好 是阿憨
Oh, no, it's Han.

359
00:17:35,140 --> 00:17:36,680
好奇他打来干嘛
Wonder what he wants.

360
00:17:37,220 --> 00:17:38,160
你觉得他是不是终于发现
You think he finally realized

361
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:40,000
我把餐厅答录机的录音改成
I changed the outgoing message on the diner

362
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:40,860
"欢迎致电拉稀小镇"
to "Welcome to Diarrhea-ville?"

363
00:17:43,340 --> 00:17:45,680
麦克斯 我听到答录机的录音了
Max, I heard the outgoing message,

364
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:49,460
我还发现我办公室有一系列《小鬼当家》风的陷阱
and I found a series of Home Alone-style traps in my office,

365
00:17:50,100 --> 00:17:52,840
一个比一个更邪恶更妙
each one more fiendishly clever than the last.

366
00:17:53,620 --> 00:17:57,080
我不知道你怎么把那些山羊弄进他办公室
And I don't know how you got those goats in his office,

367
00:17:57,080 --> 00:18:00,100
但我们现在很难把它们弄出去
but we're having a hard time getting them out.

368
00:18:02,420 --> 00:18:03,640
下一招是啥 麦克斯
What's next, Max?

369
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:06,280
是什么会让我最终折服[下跪]
What will finally bring me to my knees?

370
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:08,700
不知道 一个长得像女孩的男孩吗
I don't know. A guy who kind of looks like a girl?

371
00:18:10,340 --> 00:18:12,400
为什么你要对我百般折磨
Why are you doing all of this to me?

372
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:15,360
我只是不希望我不在的时候 你忘了我
I just didn't want you to forget me while I was away.

373
00:18:16,620 --> 00:18:17,400
麦克斯
Oh, Max.

374
00:18:17,740 --> 00:18:19,860
你说得我都要落泪了
Now you've brought me to tears.

375
00:18:35,260 --> 00:18:36,360
恭喜 麦克斯
Congratulations, Max.

376
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,440
你终于惹他生气[给他羊]了
You finally got his goat.

377
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:47,260
快来人救我
Somebody help me!

378
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:49,180
保护好蛋蛋
Cover those nuts.

379
00:18:49,360 --> 00:18:50,800
说不定某天传宗接代时会需要
You may need them one day.

380
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:56,000
我喜欢你是个东西海岸恶霸
I like that you're a bi-coastal bully.

381
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:57,840
我们第二部可以拍这个
That might be our sequel.

382
00:18:59,140 --> 00:19:00,780
我忘了告诉你
Oh, I forgot to tell you.

383
00:19:00,780 --> 00:19:02,336
我邀请了两位男士过来
I invited a couple of guys over.

384
00:19:02,336 --> 00:19:05,740
谁 我现在可是名花有主的
Who? I'm kind of seeing someone-ish.

385
00:19:05,740 --> 00:19:06,660
是兰迪和鲍伯啦
It's Randy and Bob.

386
00:19:09,660 --> 00:19:10,940
鲍伯是真实存在的吗
Bob was real?

387
00:19:11,860 --> 00:19:13,600
我以为他是个老鬼呢
I thought he was a ghost.

388
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:18,060
姑娘们 我带了香槟
Hey, girls. I brought some bubbly

389
00:19:18,060 --> 00:19:19,960
来庆祝你们今天的胜利
to celebrate your victory today,

390
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:23,020
鲍伯带了多种多样的鸦片和兴奋剂
and Bob brought a wide variety of opiates and stimulants.

391
00:19:26,980 --> 00:19:28,960
我很高兴看到你俩为友情坚持到底
Oh, I'm glad to see you two stuck it out.

392
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:30,700
真正的友谊犹如凤毛麟角
True friendship is a rare thing.

393
00:19:30,700 --> 00:19:33,120
这世上我只相信过一个人
There's only one man I've ever trusted,

394
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:36,247
就是安杰丽卡·休斯顿
and that is Anjelica Huston.

395
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:47,680
哇靠
Holy crap!

396
00:19:48,540 --> 00:19:50,520
是上帝来接鲍伯了吧
I think God is here for Bob.

397
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:57,040
这直升机是来接你的吗
Is that chopper for you?

398
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:59,000
你说得太对了
You bet your ass it is.

399
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:01,000
我要去马里布
I'm going to Malibu.

400
00:20:01,780 --> 00:20:03,777
苏珊·萨兰登叫了披萨
Susan Sarandon is ordering pizza.

401
00:20:03,777 --> 00:20:06,137
我们要嗑摇头丸
We're doing molly.

402
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:08,380
鲍伯
Bob.

403
00:20:09,660 --> 00:20:11,260
我们还会见面吗
Will I ever see you again?

404
00:20:12,740 --> 00:20:15,640
别着急 小猫咪 我才刚出来
Slow down, pussycat. I'm just getting out of something.

405
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,880
那男人的确非常了解该如何退场
That man sure knows how to make an exit.

406
00:20:23,460 --> 00:20:25,300
不是退出生命 而是退出其他事情
Not from life, but from everything else.

407
00:20:26,460 --> 00:20:27,540
我得走了 宝贝
I gotta go, doll.

408
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:34,720
鲍伯会顺道送我回家
Bob's gonna drop me off at home.

409
00:20:36,020 --> 00:20:37,640
希望这次我能降落在泳池里
Hopefully, I'll land in my pool this time.

410
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:44,720
我不知道是什么原因 但是...
I don't know what it is, but

411
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:46,880
鲍伯令我疯狂
I'm crazy about Bob.

412
00:20:50,140 --> 00:20:51,060
我懂 妹子
Get it, girl.
